      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "How would you ask to see the menu?",
      "cacheKey": "a58e7e04e07d402dba01fbfdca994d55debace5388de4b99c14595a0469ec064",
      "file": "audio/cache/a58e7e04e07d402dba01fbfdca994d55debace5388de4b99c14595a0469ec064.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q1-answer",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q1",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "메뉴판 좀 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "20abc2021665949aff20127a2bcfac9e6adf054e7fc3394fe911ce42ec2517d6",
      "file": "audio/cache/20abc2021665949aff20127a2bcfac9e6adf054e7fc3394fe911ce42ec2517d6.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q1-explanation",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q1",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This is a polite way to ask for the menu. The ending means you’re asking someone to give you something.",
      "cacheKey": "65bb25244cbd29f6d0b36121099d54e301926c42d7e7ee3239399355ea295797",
      "file": "audio/cache/65bb25244cbd29f6d0b36121099d54e301926c42d7e7ee3239399355ea295797.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q2-question",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q2",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What would you ask for?",
      "cacheKey": "92a9c0718ade79e41d6d8f9bc4530abec1f4d93d91b1e9c86d00db5543909144",
      "file": "audio/cache/92a9c0718ade79e41d6d8f9bc4530abec1f4d93d91b1e9c86d00db5543909144.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q2-answer",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q2",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "케이크 한 조각 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "cd9c2b5e095a68f95d9ec86f9acbf90a00401e9ab6760de88eef18e1c8a53f18",
      "file": "audio/cache/cd9c2b5e095a68f95d9ec86f9acbf90a00401e9ab6760de88eef18e1c8a53f18.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q2-explanation",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q2",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks for one slice of cake. The counting phrase means one piece or slice.",
      "cacheKey": "f218720020502ebc49addb8111acf36d1247fa4053aad2eac4c0373c38c68238",
      "file": "audio/cache/f218720020502ebc49addb8111acf36d1247fa4053aad2eac4c0373c38c68238.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q3-question",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q3",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "How can you politely request a fork?",
      "cacheKey": "e9e548a6414f3916f11e441ba9f8ae96bdd69bafada8449874f8ff93fd293a70",
      "file": "audio/cache/e9e548a6414f3916f11e441ba9f8ae96bdd69bafada8449874f8ff93fd293a70.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q3-answer",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q3",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "포크 하나 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "656a1a9f31b437e7d7bc8bdfc3503f2631d3c4ee1ef8ee5837d8243fd679da6c",
      "file": "audio/cache/656a1a9f31b437e7d7bc8bdfc3503f2631d3c4ee1ef8ee5837d8243fd679da6c.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q3-explanation",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q3",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "This asks for one fork. The word for one comes before the polite request.",
      "cacheKey": "991c4ccb7e191802d13b109a14eaf137d9016303d4676007e6f9fa6e5eb20307",
      "file": "audio/cache/991c4ccb7e191802d13b109a14eaf137d9016303d4676007e6f9fa6e5eb20307.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cafe-dessert-04-q4-question",
      "contentId": "cafe-dessert-04-q4",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What would you ask the server to bring?",
      "cacheKey": "3f2186b9f3cef4159c0079fb3e36f447b0221e0f8a926ce931696caeaa307097",
      "file": "audio/cache/3f2186b9f3cef4159c0079fb3e36f447b0221e0f8a926ce931696caeaa307097.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
